# Third-party model weights

The served dots.tts checkpoint is prepared from Apache-2.0 sources:

- dots-studio/dots.tts-soar (Apache-2.0; base dots-studio/dots.tts-base): the
  TTS checkpoint the native runtime synthesizes with.
- Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct (Apache-2.0): the LLM backbone inside the
  converted checkpoint (llm.model, eos_proj).

The behavior reference is the sglang Python CUDA path under
sglang_omni/models/dots_tts/ and the official dots_tts package. The served
checkpoint is mlx-community/dots-tts-mlx-int4, the published 4-bit MLX
conversion of dots-studio/dots.tts-soar (Apache-2.0; base
dots-studio/dots.tts-base); its revisions and per-file SHA-256 are pinned in
ci/model_pins.json.